<td data-local-id=3D"ecf2cef6-dc1a-48da-aae7-7dff0b06badd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1ccc235f1c1e">Pasient se=C3=A7diyi h=C9=99kimin bo=C5=9F vax=
tlar=C4=B1ndan birini se=C3=A7=C9=99r=C9=99k randevu yarad=C4=B1r. =C3=96d=
=C9=99ni=C5=9F platformada apar=C4=B1lm=C4=B1r =E2=80=94 m=C3=BCayin=C9=99n=
in =C5=9F=C9=99rtl=C9=99ri v=C9=99 d=C9=99y=C9=99ri klinikada m=C3=BC=C9=99=
yy=C9=99n edilir. Bu, platforman=C4=B1n =C9=99sas d=C9=99y=C9=99r yaradan p=
rosesidir v=C9=99 manual telefon randevusunu =C9=99v=C9=99z edir.</p>
