nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c8793e994c76">=C4=B0stifad=C9=99=C3=A7i qeydiyyatdan ke=C3=
=A7m=C9=99yibs=C9=99, sistem return URL kimi <code>/booking/{doctorId}</cod=
e> saxlay=C4=B1r v=C9=99 qeydiyyata y=C3=B6nl=C9=99ndirir (UC-101). Qeydiyy=
